text.section:
The report of condition shall include:

Financial information at the licensee level;


Nationwide and state-specific money transmission transaction information for every jurisdiction in the United States where the licensee is licensed to engage in money transmission;


A permissible investments report;


Transaction destination country reporting for money received for transmission, if applicable; and


Any other information the Commission reasonably requires with respect to the licensee. The Commission is authorized and encouraged to allow or require licensees to utilize NMLS for the submission of the report required by this section.
